<title>RUSSIA: WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - June 21-22.</title>
<headline>WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - June 21-22.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Airports in the autonomous republic of Tatarstan may be closed on June 21 due to heavy thunderstorms, the Russian Weather Service said on Friday.</p>
<p>The probability of closure was 80 percent.</p>
<p>The service also said flights on June 22 at airports in the Urals area could be postponed due to heavy rains. - Moscow Newsroom +7095 941 8520</p>
<p>www.racs.com</p>
